{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102491","id":2320458912,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6KT2Sg","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102491","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102491.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102491.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102491","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102491/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102491/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102491/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/edd32640ff29777f9fe384317cdd8d533223c838","number":102491,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"[Buildsystem] Make compiled files dependent on the compiler version","user":{"login":"adamscott","id":270928,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MDkyOA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/270928?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott","html_url":"https://github.com/adamscott","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"> [!NOTE]\r\n> This PR introduce caching for `get_compiler_version()` for performance reasons. But the compiler shouldn't really change mid-configuration, so I think it's ok.\r\n\r\nThis PR makes the compiled files dependent on the compiler version.\r\n\r\nThis is especially useful for the Web platform, as we need often to change versions of emscripten that break or fix things. Currently, we need to force clearing the cache (using `scons -c` and `scons --cache-disable`) and it's not really easy to explain in the documentation. Making the build system automatically rebuild the files would help tremendously.\r\n\r\n~~But otherwise, I think it's a good idea in general. We shouldn't really mix and match old cached built files with new ones from a newer compiler.~~\r\n\r\nedit: I just learned that SCons actually check for the compiler binary, if there's any changes. But as `emcc` is a wrapper (emcc is just an executable ~~python file~~ bash file that calls a python script with the rest of the arguments), it may still have the same checksum as a previous version, hence breaking SCons detection system.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098009,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwMDk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:buildsystem","name":"topic:buildsystem","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2025-02-06T17:09:51Z","updated_at":"2025-02-10T21:17:09Z","closed_at":"2025-02-10T21:16:54Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"bc125b25c9dc77e35fcd8887631c